  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Strengthened capacity of member States to ratify and apply international labour standards and to fulfil their reporting obligations</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Liberia is in the process of ratifying ILO Convention 160 amongst other Conventions. In addition, it has not been meeting with up with its reporting obligations to the ILO on the application of ratified convention. Furthermore, the Committee of Experts on Application od Standards had requested for several amendments to the 2015 Decent Work Act, including in relation to the prohibition for workers.
The intervention focuses on provide technical advice, developing capacities and ILO facilitates social dialogue for the tripartite to address the issues raised by Committee of Experts of Standards.</narrative>
  </description>
